{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02979","headline":"始兴南山下有林泉尝卜居焉荆州卧病有怀此地 · 张九龄","name":"始兴南山下有林泉尝卜居焉荆州卧病有怀此地","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"出处各有在，何者爲陆沈。\n幸无迫贱事，聊可祛迷襟。\n世路少夷坦，孟门未岖嶔。\n多慙入火术，常惕履冰心。\n一跌不自保，万全焉可寻。\n行行念归路，眇眇惜光阴。\n浮生如过隙，先达已吾箴。\n敢忘丘山施，亦云年病侵。\n力衰在所养，时谢良不任。\n但忆旧栖息，愿言遂窥临。\n云间日孤秀，山下面清深。\n萝茑自爲幄，风泉何必琴。\n归此老吾老，还当日千金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02979.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02979","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}